@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Mengedit Data Rekap Presensi Siswa (Tata Usaha)

actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary View as V
control Controller as C
entity Model as M

== Akses Halaman Rekap Presensi ==

TU -> V: 1. Akses Dashboard
V --> TU: Tampilkan Dashboard

TU -> V: 2. Pilih "Presensi Siswa" > "Rekap Kehadiran"
V -> C: Handle navigation
C -> M: Get attendance data
M --> C: Return data with auto-generated absences
C -> V: Load rekap page
V --> TU: Tampilkan halaman rekap

TU -> V: 3. Pilih tampilan "Table"
V -> C: Handle table view
C -> M: Get detailed attendance records
M --> C: Return student records
C -> V: Generate table
V --> TU: Tampilkan tabel rekap kehadiran

== Edit Status Kehadiran ==

group Edit Status
    TU -> V: 4. Klik tombol "Sakit" atau "Izin" pada siswa
    V -> C: Handle status update
    C -> M: Update attendance status
    M --> C: Status updated
    C -> V: Show success notification
    V --> TU: Konfirmasi perubahan status
    
    C -> V: Update table display
    V --> TU: Tampilkan status terbaru
end

== Auto Assignment (Sistem) ==

group Auto Alfa
    note over C, M: Setelah jam sekolah berakhir
    C -> M: Check students without manual update
    M --> C: List of unupdated students
    C -> M: Auto-assign "Alfa" status
    M --> C: Alfa status assigned
    C -> V: Update final attendance
end

== Error Handling ==

alt Record Editable
    C -> M: Check if record can be edited
    M --> C: Record is editable
    note right: Proceed with update
else Record Finalized
    M --> C: Record already finalized
    C -> V: Show error message
    V --> TU: "Data sudah tervalidasi, tidak dapat diubah"
end

note over TU, M
**Pre-kondisi:**
- Tata Usaha login di dashboard
- Data rekap otomatis sudah dibuat

**Post-kondisi:**
- Status siswa berubah dari default ke "Sakit"/"Izin"
- Siswa tidak diedit otomatis menjadi "Alfa"
- Data tervalidasi setelah jam sekolah
end note

@enduml